# Build-context allow-list
# ------------------------
# The production Dockerfile clones and builds Douban MCP itself, installs the
# hosted Python requirements, and copies only app/. Everything else in this
# 5+ GiB development workspace is unnecessary and may contain local state.
**

# Files required by the production Dockerfile.
!Dockerfile
!requirements-hosted.txt

# FastAPI application source. The parent directory must be re-included before
# Docker can follow the recursive app/** exception.
!app
!app/**
